bby\"><div class=\"lobby__side\"><div class=\"about-side\"><p>Omok.dev is a free, open source omok service focused on real-time play, browser-side AI, and opening study.</p><a class=\"blue\" href=\"/source\">Source Code</a><br><a class=\"button button-empty\" href=\"/dev/omok/opening-guide\">Open the opening guide</a><a class=\"button button-empty\" href=\"/omok/solo\">Open the solo board</a></div></div><div class=\"lobby__app lobby__app-pools lck-pools\"><div class=\"tabs-horiz\" role=\"tablist\"><button class=\"active\" role=\"tab\">Quick pairing</button><button role=\"tab\">Lobby</button><button role=\"tab\">Correspondence</button></div><div class=\"lobby__app__content lpools\"><div class=\"lpool\" role=\"button\" data-id=\"1+0\" tabindex=\"0\"><div class=\"clock\">1+0</div><div class=\"perf\">Bullet</div></div><div class=\"lpool\" role=\"button\" data-id=\"2+1\" tabindex=\"0\"><div class=\"clock\">2+1</div><div class=\"perf\">Bullet</div></div><div class=\"lpool\" role=\"button\" data-id=\"3+0\" tabindex=\"0\"><div class=\"clock\">3+0</div><div class=\"perf\">Blitz</div></div><div class=\"lpool\" role=\"button\" data-id=\"3+2\" tabindex=\"0\"><div class=\"clock\">3+2</div><div class=\"perf\">Blitz</div></div><div class=\"lpool\" role=\"button\" data-id=\"5+0\" tabindex=\"0\"><div class=\"clock\">5+0</div><div class=\"perf\">Blitz</div></div><div class=\"lpool\" role=\"button\" data-id=\"5+3\" tabindex=\"0\"><div class=\"clock\">5+3</div><div class=\"perf\">Blitz</div></div><div class=\"lpool\" role=\"button\" data-id=\"10+0\" tabindex=\"0\"><div class=\"clock\">10+0</div><div class=\"perf\">Rapid</div></div><div class=\"lpool\" role=\"button\" data-id=\"10+5\" tabindex=\"0\"><div class=\"clock\">10+5</div><div class=\"perf\">Rapid</div></div><div class=\"lpool\" role=\"button\" data-id=\"15+10\" tabindex=\"0\"><div class=\"clock\">15+10</div><div class=\"perf\">Rapid</div></div><div class=\"lpool\" role=\"button\" data-id=\"30+0\" tabindex=\"0\"><div class=\"clo